{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"09e4804fcd4aae5414bac27bcf2a8135d9baa7ba05f34eb4c19c9a59abd2cfde","ja":"今日のお仕事は、生放送のテレビ番組出演。\nみんなは楽屋で出番を待っていて……","zh":"今天的工作是出演电视直播节目。\n大家正在休息室里等待出场……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"73220ef5b40a1183397662e23bafa73ee809f48d904f75a23848a0b00c6e60ac","ja":"う～ん、やっぱりダメか～……。","zh":"唔～果然还是不行吗～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"75204c14237bd2e6bc0af79ccd815cc330d4170b5c77d4c22dde75bce761e590","ja":"どうしたの、美奈子？　何か悩み事？","zh":"怎么了，美奈子？有什么烦心事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"16b2f3df268965f1d059934e258d7a6b6b6c880e2a1b8d320e8f50c9807a5f55","ja":"悩み事ってほどじゃないんだけど……。","zh":"倒也算不上是什么烦恼……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e9798c3950c5b8922270374a01c16289f519d2ed5321428d18d9274b9422ca6c","ja":"この前ね、公演を見てくれた友達と、「クロエみたいな\n流行を作れる子って憧れるよね」って話をしたの。","zh":"前阵子我和来看演出的朋友聊过，\n说“真憧憬像克洛伊那样能引领潮流的女孩子呢”。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"02584300c22cd88ae0aabe5c31f0b20f8a01ee841d36dcba452a9fd32750a35b","ja":"それで試しに、いろいろ投稿してみたんだけど、\n全然バズらないな～って……。","zh":"所以试着发了各种各样的内容，\n但完全没有火起来呢～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c5cd935e715499cebd19448902072072a3f8464b8f9baf93b75a9167c4886c80","ja":"狙ってバズらせるのって、\nすっごく、難しそうですよね～。","zh":"想要特意引爆话题，\n感觉真的非常难呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7ffe7729f7c7b2cdf592deb075aad3842bfa586f6c259685caf35cc8367746f1","ja":"そのつもりがなかったのにバズっちゃった～、\nってお話はよく聞くけどネ。","zh":"明明没那个打算却一下子爆红了～，\n这种事倒是经常听说呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"1d479ef8e13925f4eb512eaad1a18c646017dddd501d9611d2f1bb99caf194cd","ja":"そもそもバズるって、\n『何気ないこと』から生まれるものなんじゃない？","zh":"说到底所谓走红，\n不就是从“不经意的小事”中诞生的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6ee5fd5831191dc90f29dc9467593268b610e76f5870b8adac54b78441aa49e6","ja":"そうだよね……。私も、公演前に少しだけ\n調べてみたことがあるけど……。","zh":"也是呢……。我也在演出前稍微\n调查过一下就是了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"f51cab3f30808d40720ba4008e839982340f316be9510fc6499b6ed73ac5b478","ja":"共感を得やすい内容だったり、\n見た目にインパクトがあったり……。","zh":"容易引起共鸣的内容，\n或者在视觉上很有冲击感……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e2ba3a2d46c70b0818955412c7d548243a6a9838bb49bb4171e97c0695b93e45","ja":"議論が活発化する内容だったり、\nっていう要素があると、比較的バズりやすいのかも？","zh":"如果是能引发热烈讨论的内容，\n包含这类要素的话，或许相对更容易引发热议？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"d480ac1f5bfac75853b9bb2f362a0da7eff2fb3074cbbc639382cc28f02951a0","ja":"ただ、SNSって言い方ひとつで炎上しちゃうから、\nその辺のバランス感覚も大事なんだよねー。","zh":"不过，社交媒体上只要措辞不当就会引发舆论风波，\n拿捏好分寸也是很重要的呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"8318cbf41b85f717aa48b06a9ef412b902c7cf32db2271fdd507b7c886e085d3","ja":"そうなんだ。それじゃあ、何度もバズってた\nクロエって本当に凄かったんだね……。","zh":"原来是这样啊。这么说来，屡次引发话题的\n克洛艾真的很厉害呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"9920ca2e72a910c6a1397ce5570ea3d1e5fd85d3068c388945a078023c75506d","ja":"「765プロさん、本番お願いしま～す！」","zh":"「765事务所各位，正式演出要拜托大家啦～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1454.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"7f99e8a777b73bd63a30fe29485ea24a424a6786bb13b18c98d8534dfb2e83ef","ja":"あっ、はい！　とりあえずバズるお話は\n置いておいて、今日のお仕事頑張ろう！","zh":"啊，好的！先不管走红的话题，\n今天的工作也要加油！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
